wer borrowing costs does the opposite."}],"related":[{"slug":"aggregate-bank-deposits","title":"Aggregate Bank Deposits"},{"slug":"bank-credit-industry","title":"Bank Credit - Industry"},{"slug":"bank-credit-personal-loans","title":"Bank Credit - Personal Loans"},{"slug":"bank-credit-services","title":"Bank Credit - Services"},{"slug":"cash-reserve-ratio-crr","title":"Cash Reserve Ratio (CRR)"},{"slug":"credit-deposit-ratio","title":"Credit-Deposit Ratio"},{"slug":"foreign-exchange-reserves","title":"Foreign Exchange Reserves"},{"slug":"foreign-portfolio-investments-fpis-debt","title":"Foreign Portfolio Investments (FPIs) - Debt"},{"slug":"marginal-cost-of-funds-based-lending-rates-mclr","title":"Marginal Cost of Funds based Lending Rates (MCLR)"},{"slug":"money-supply-m3","title":"Money Supply (M3)"},{"slug":"nifty-bank-pe-ratio","title":"NIFTY Bank P/E Ratio"},{"slug":"rbi-liquidity-net-laf","title":"RBI Liquidity (Net LAF)"},{"slug":"repo-rate","title":"Repo Rate"},{"slug":"statutory-liquidity-ratio-slr","title":"Statutory Liquidity Ratio (SLR)"},{"slug":"term-deposit-rate","title":"Term Deposit Rate"}],"title":"Weighted Average Lending Rate on Fresh Rupee Loans (WALR)","description":"The weighted average lending rate on fresh rupee loans stands at 8.61% for Aug 2026. WALR moves faster than MCLR since it reflects rates on loans actually being sanctioned.","headline":{"Absolute":"The weighted average lending rate on fresh rupee loans stands at 8.61% for Aug 2026. WALR moves faster than MCLR since it reflects rates on loans actually being sanctioned."},"source":"CMIE Economic Outlook, 1 Finance Research","source_url":"https://economicoutlook.cmie.com/","date_modified":"2026-08-01","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T23:59:16+00:00"}